#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_template_save
msgid ""
"Save a report layout you use often and recreate it in one click. Interactive"
" tour of the 'File > Save as Template' flow; it needs the Template Manager "
"access right and a desktop-size screen."
msgstr ""

#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_vendor_scorecard
msgid ""
"Score and compare vendors on delivery, quality and price metrics, to see "
"which vendors perform well in a wholesale or dealer supply chain."
msgstr ""

#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_quote_conversion
msgid ""
"See how many quotations turned into orders and the conversion percentage. A "
"dealer-sales indicator to follow the sales funnel and the quotation success "
"rate."
msgstr ""

#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_dashboard_sale
msgid ""
"See sales team performance at a glance: Revenue, Orders, Units Sold, Average"
" Order Value (compared with the previous period), the monthly revenue trend "
"and the latest orders. Salesperson and product category filters. Appears "
"automatically under Dashboards > Sales."
msgstr ""

#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_dashboard_purchase
msgid ""
"See where your purchase budget goes: amount purchased, orders, order lines, "
"quantity ordered and days to receive, each compared with the previous "
"period, plus top vendors, orders, products and buyers and sourcing by "
"country, with period, country, vendor and buyer filters. Use it for vendor "
"reviews and before price negotiations. Example: set the Vendor filter to "
"your main supplier to see how much you bought from them in the last 90 days."
" Dashboards > Purchases, for Purchase administrators."
msgstr ""

#. module: spreadsheet_help_oca
#: model:spreadsheet.tutorial,description:spreadsheet_help_oca.tutorial_campaign_roi
msgid ""
"Sent, delivered, opened and clicked counts of completed email campaigns and "
"the monthly delivery trend. NOTE: despite the 'ROI' name there is no real "
"revenue or coupon attribution yet — it only measures email engagement."
msgstr ""

